  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 20th level the sphereshaper gains the ability three times a day to realign their akashic affinity and mnemonic insight selections as a full-round action.</p>\n<p>This ability also instantly reshapes all of their veils, reforging themselves into an avatar made of new collective experiences. This ability doesn’t provoke attacks of opportunity; any veil shaped this way can be bound to an associated chakra as part of this process. Whenever they use this ability they gain a temporary pool of essence in addition to their normal pool equal to 3 + their Intelligence modifier; this essence lasts for 3 rounds and can only be used to power the veils they formed using their veilshifting ability.</p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/sphereshaper#toc10\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
